#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:4
msgid "¿What are the Seals of Excellence?"
msgstr "¿Que Son Los Sellos de Excelencia?"

#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:8
msgid ""
"\n"
"The Seals of Excellence in Digital Government is a recognition from the "
"MinTIC\n"
"\t of digital services and open datasets that meet "
"high\n"
"\t standards of quality, security, accessibility, and transparency."
"It certifies that\n"
"\t the State's digital products respond to the needs of ""citizens,\n"
"\t comply with regulations, promote trust and participation, and "
"guarantee continuous\n"
"\t improvement. For open data, it ensures that it is useful, "
"up-to-date\n"
"\t and reusable.\n"
"       "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"       Los Sellos de Excelencia en Gobierno Digital es un reconocimiento del "
"MinTIC\n"
"\t   a los servicios digitales y conjuntos de datos abiertos que cumplen con "
"altos\n"
"\t   estándares de calidad, seguridad, accesibilidad y transparencia. "
"Certifica que\n"
"\t   los productos digitales del Estado responden a las necesidades "
"ciudadanas,\n"
"\t   cumplen la normativa, promueven la confianza y participación, y "
"garantizan la\n"
"\t   mejora continua. En los datos abiertos, asegura que sean útiles, "
"actualizados\n"
"\t   y reutilizables..\n"
"      "
